  {
   "name": "Administrative Policy and Grant Management",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The committee continuously refines its administrative operations, including the hiring of a full-time CPA manager in 2023. Key policy changes include increasing the small grant limit from $5,000 to $10,000 and removing mandatory matching requirements to increase accessibility. The committee also establishes annual budget set-asides, recently increasing the minimum allocation for affordable housing to 15%. Ongoing efforts include improving application transparency through online templates and public outreach via QR codes and community events.",
